      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"35\" type=\"品\">35 如來隨好光明功德品</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"49\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c04\">0257c04</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c05\">0257c05</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c06\">0257c06</span><cb:juan n=\"049\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"049\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0257004\">卷首少缺【聖】</span><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第四十九</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c07\">0257c07</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c08\">0257c08</span><byline><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0257005\">（唐）＋于【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0257005\">于【大】，唐于【明】</span><app n=\"0257005\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">唐于</rdg></app>闐國<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0257c01\"/>三藏實叉難陀<anchor xml:id=\"fxT10p0257c02\"/>奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c09\">0257c09</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"36\" type=\"品\">36 普賢行品</cb:mulu><head>普賢行品第三十六</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c10\">0257c10</span><p>爾時，普賢菩薩摩訶薩復告諸菩薩大眾言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c11\">0257c11</span><p>「佛子！如向所演，此但隨眾生根器所宜，略說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c12\">0257c12</span>如來少分境界。何以故？諸佛世尊，為諸眾生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c13\">0257c13</span>無智作惡，計我、我所，執著於身，顛倒疑惑，邪\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c14\">0257c14</span>見分別，與諸結縛恒共相應，隨生死流遠如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c15\">0257c15</span>來道故，出興<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0257006\">于＝於【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0257006\">于【大】，於【明】</span><app n=\"0257006\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">於</rdg></app>世。佛子！我不見一法為大過\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c16\">0257c16</span>失，如諸菩薩於他菩薩起瞋心者。何以故？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c17\">0257c17</span>佛子！若諸菩薩於餘菩薩起瞋恚心，即成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c18\">0257c18</span>就百萬障門故。何等為百萬障？所謂：不見菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c19\">0257c19</span>提障；不聞正法障；生不淨世界障；生諸惡趣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c20\">0257c20</span>障；生諸難處障；多諸疾病障；多被謗毀障；生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c21\">0257c21</span>頑鈍諸趣障；壞失正念障；闕少智慧障；眼障；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c22\">0257c22</span>耳障；鼻障；舌障；身障；意障；惡知識障；惡伴黨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c23\">0257c23</span>障；樂習小乘障；樂近凡庸障；不信樂大威德\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c24\">0257c24</span>人障；樂與離正見人同住障；生外道家障；住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c25\">0257c25</span>魔境界障；離佛正教障；不見善友障；善根留\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c26\">0257c26</span>難障；增不善法障；得下劣處障；生邊地障；生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c27\">0257c27</span>惡人家障；生惡神中障；生惡龍、惡夜叉、惡乾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c28\">0257c28</span>闥婆、惡阿脩羅、惡迦樓羅、惡緊那羅、惡摩睺\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0257c29\">0257c29</span>羅伽、惡羅剎中障；不樂佛法障；習童蒙法障；\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a01\">0258a01</span>樂著小乘障；不樂大乘障；性多驚怖障；心常\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a02\">0258a02</span>憂惱障；愛著生死障；不專佛法障；不喜見聞\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a03\">0258a03</span>佛自在神通障；不得菩薩諸根障；不行菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a04\">0258a04</span>淨行障；退怯菩薩深心障；不生菩薩大願障；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a05\">0258a05</span>不發一切智心障；於菩薩行懈怠障；不能淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a06\">0258a06</span>治諸業障；不能攝取大福障；智力不能明利\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a07\">0258a07</span>障；斷於廣大智慧障；不護持菩薩諸行障；樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a08\">0258a08</span>誹謗一切智語障；遠離諸佛菩提障；樂住眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a09\">0258a09</span>魔境界障；不專修佛境界障；不決定發菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a10\">0258a10</span>弘誓障；不樂與菩薩同住障；不求菩薩善根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a11\">0258a11</span>障；性多見疑障；心常愚闇障；不能行菩薩平\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a12\">0258a12</span>等施故，起不捨障；不能持如來戒故，起破戒\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a13\">0258a13</span>障；不能入堪忍門故，起愚癡、惱害、瞋恚障；不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a14\">0258a14</span>能行菩薩大精進故，起懈怠垢障；不能得諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a15\">0258a15</span>三昧故，起散亂障；不修治般若波羅蜜故，起\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a16\">0258a16</span>惡慧障；於處、非處中無善巧障；於度眾生中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a17\">0258a17</span>無方便障；於菩薩智慧中不能觀察障；於菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a18\">0258a18</span>薩出離法中不能了知障；不成就菩薩十種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a19\">0258a19</span>廣大眼故，眼如生盲障；耳不聞無礙法故，口\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a20\">0258a20</span>如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0258001\">啞＝瘂【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0258001\">啞【大】，瘂【宮】</span><app n=\"0258001\"><p class=\"lg\">啞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">瘂</rdg></app>羊障；不具相好故，鼻根破壞障；不能辨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a21\">0258a21</span>了眾生語言故，成就舌根障；輕賤眾生故，成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a22\">0258a22</span>就身根障；心多狂亂故，成就意根障；不持三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a23\">0258a23</span>種律儀故，成就身業障；恒起四種過失故，成\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a24\">0258a24</span>就語業障；多生貪、瞋、邪見故，成就意業障；賊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a25\">0258a25</span>心求法障；斷絕菩薩境界障；於菩薩勇猛法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a26\">0258a26</span>中心生退怯障；於菩薩出離道中心生嬾惰\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a27\">0258a27</span>障；於菩薩智慧光明門中心生止息障；於菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a28\">0258a28</span>薩念力中心生劣弱障；於如來教法中不能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258a29\">0258a29</span>住持障；於菩薩離生道不能親近障；於菩薩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b01\">0258b01</span>無失壞道不能修習障；隨順二乘正位障；遠\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b02\">0258b02</span>離三世諸佛菩薩種性障。</p><p>「佛子！若菩薩於諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b03\">0258b03</span>菩薩起一瞋心，則成就如是等百萬障門。何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b04\">0258b04</span>以故？佛子！我不見有一法為大過惡，如諸菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b05\">0258b05</span>薩於餘菩薩起瞋心者。是故，諸菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b06\">0258b06</span>薩欲疾滿足諸菩薩行，應勤修十種法。何等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b07\">0258b07</span>為十？所謂：心不棄捨一切眾生，於諸菩薩生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b08\">0258b08</span>如來想，永不誹謗一切佛法，知諸國土無有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b09\">0258b09</span>窮盡，於菩薩行深生信樂，不捨平等虛空法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b10\">0258b10</span>界菩提之心，觀察菩提入如來力，精勤修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b11\">0258b11</span>習無礙辯才，教化眾生無有疲厭，住一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b12\">0258b12</span>世界心無所著。是為十。</p><p>「佛子！菩薩摩訶薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b13\">0258b13</span>安住此十法已，則能具足十種清淨。何等為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b14\">0258b14</span>十？所謂：通達甚深法清淨，親近善知識清淨，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b15\">0258b15</span>護持諸佛法清淨，了達虛空界清淨，深入法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b16\">0258b16</span>界清淨，觀察無邊心清淨，與一切菩薩同善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b17\">0258b17</span>根清淨，不著諸劫清淨，觀察三世清淨，修行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b18\">0258b18</span>一切諸佛法清淨。是為十。</p><p>「佛子！菩薩摩訶薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b19\">0258b19</span>住此十法已，則具足十種廣大智。何等為十？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b20\">0258b20</span>所謂：知一切眾生心行智，知一切眾生業報\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b21\">0258b21</span>智，知一切佛法智，知一切佛法深密理趣智，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b22\">0258b22</span>知一切陀羅尼門智，知一切文字辯才智，知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b23\">0258b23</span>一切眾生語言、音聲、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0258002\">辭＝詞【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0258002\">辭【大】，詞【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0258002\"><p class=\"lg\">辭</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">詞</rdg></app>辯善巧智，於一切世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b24\">0258b24</span>界中普現其身智，於一切眾會中普現影像\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b25\">0258b25</span>智，於一切受生處中具一切智智。是為十。</p><p>「佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b26\">0258b26</span>子！菩薩摩訶薩住此十智已，則得入十種普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b27\">0258b27</span>入。何等為十？所謂：一切世界入一毛道，一毛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b28\">0258b28</span>道入一切世界；一切眾生身入一身，一身入\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258b29\">0258b29</span>一切眾生身；不可說劫入一念，一念入不可\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c01\">0258c01</span>說劫；一切佛法入一法，一法入一切佛法；不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c02\">0258c02</span>可說處入一處，一處入不可說處；不可說根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c03\">0258c03</span>入一根，一根入不可說根；一切根入非根，非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c04\">0258c04</span>根入一切根；一切想入一想，一想入一切想；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c05\">0258c05</span>一切言音入一言音，一言音入一切言音；一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c06\">0258c06</span>切三世入一世，一世入一切三世。是為十。</p><p>「佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c07\">0258c07</span>子！菩薩摩訶薩如是觀察已，則住十種勝妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c08\">0258c08</span>心。何等為十？所謂：住一切世界語言、非語言\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c09\">0258c09</span>勝妙心，住一切眾生想念無所依止勝妙心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c10\">0258c10</span>住究竟虛空界勝妙心，住無邊法界勝妙心，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c11\">0258c11</span>住一切深密佛法勝妙心，住甚深無差別法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c12\">0258c12</span>勝妙心，住除滅一切疑惑勝妙心，住一切世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c13\">0258c13</span>平等無差別勝妙心，住三世諸佛平等勝妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c14\">0258c14</span>心，住一切諸佛力無量勝妙心。是為十。</p><p>「佛子！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c15\">0258c15</span>菩薩摩訶薩住此十種勝妙心已，則得十種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c16\">0258c16</span>佛法善巧智。何等為十？所謂：了達甚深佛法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c17\">0258c17</span>善巧智，出生廣大佛法善巧智，宣說種種佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c18\">0258c18</span>法善巧智，證入平等佛法善巧智，明了差別\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c19\">0258c19</span>佛法善巧智，悟解無差別佛法善巧智，深入\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c20\">0258c20</span>莊嚴佛法善巧智，一方便入佛法善巧智，無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c21\">0258c21</span>量方便入佛法善巧智，知無邊佛法無差別\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c22\">0258c22</span>善巧智，以自心自力於一切佛法不退轉善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c23\">0258c23</span>巧智。是為十。</p><p>「佛子！菩薩摩訶薩聞此法已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c24\">0258c24</span>咸應發心，恭敬受持。何以故？菩薩摩訶薩持\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c25\">0258c25</span>此法者，少作功力，疾得阿耨多羅三藐三菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c26\">0258c26</span>提，皆得具足一切佛法，悉與三世諸佛法等。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c27\">0258c27</span><p>爾時，佛神力故，法如是故，十方各有十不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c28\">0258c28</span>說百千億那由他佛剎微塵數世界六種震\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0258c29\">0258c29</span>動，雨出過諸天一切華雲、香雲、末香雲、衣蓋、\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a01\">0259a01</span>幢幡、摩尼寶等及以一切莊嚴具雲，雨眾妓\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a02\">0259a02</span>樂雲，雨諸菩薩雲，雨不可說如來色相雲，雨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a03\">0259a03</span>不可說讚歎如來善哉雲，雨如來音聲充滿一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a04\">0259a04</span>切法界雲，雨不可說莊嚴世界雲，雨不可說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a05\">0259a05</span>增長菩提雲，雨不可說光明照<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259001\">耀＝躍【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259001\">耀【大】，躍【宮】</span><app n=\"0259001\"><p class=\"lg\">耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">躍</rdg></app>雲，雨不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a06\">0259a06</span>說神力說法雲。如此世界四天下菩提樹下\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a07\">0259a07</span>菩提場菩薩宮殿中，見於如來成等正覺演\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a08\">0259a08</span>說此法，十方一切諸世界中悉亦如是。</p><p>爾時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a09\">0259a09</span>佛神力故，法如是故，十方各過十不可說佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a10\">0259a10</span>剎微塵數世界外，有十佛剎微塵數菩薩摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a11\">0259a11</span>訶薩來詣此土，充滿十方，作如是言：「善哉善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a12\">0259a12</span>哉！佛子！乃能說此諸佛如來最大誓願授記\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a13\">0259a13</span>深法。佛子！我等一切同名普賢，各從普勝世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a14\">0259a14</span>界普幢自在如來所來詣此土，悉以佛神力\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a15\">0259a15</span>故，於一切處演說此法；如此眾會，如是所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a16\">0259a16</span>說，一切平等無有增減。我等皆承佛威神力，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a17\">0259a17</span>來此道場為汝作證。如此道場，我等十佛剎\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a18\">0259a18</span>微塵數菩薩而來作證，十方一切諸世界中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a19\">0259a19</span>悉亦如是。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a20\">0259a20</span><p>爾時，普賢菩薩摩訶薩以佛神力、自善根力，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a21\">0259a21</span>觀察十方洎<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259002\">乎＝于【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259002\">于【CB】【明】，乎【大】</span><app n=\"0259002\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">乎</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">于</rdg></app>法界，欲開示菩薩行，欲宣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a22\">0259a22</span>說如來菩提界，欲說大願界，欲說一切世界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a23\">0259a23</span>劫數，欲明諸佛隨時出現，欲說如來隨根熟\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a24\">0259a24</span>眾生出現令其供養，欲明如來出世功不唐\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a25\">0259a25</span>捐，欲明所種善根必獲果報，欲明大威德菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a26\">0259a26</span>薩為一切眾生現形說法令其開悟，而說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a27\">0259a27</span>言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a28\">0259a28</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「汝等應歡喜，<caesura/>捨離於諸蓋，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259a29\">0259a29</span><p class=\"lg\">一心恭敬聽，<caesura/>菩薩諸願行。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b01\">0259b01</span><p class=\"lg\">往昔諸菩薩，<caesura/>最勝人師子，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b02\">0259b02</span><p class=\"lg\">如彼所修行，<caesura/>我當次第說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b03\">0259b03</span><p class=\"lg\">亦說諸劫數，<caesura/>世界并諸業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b04\">0259b04</span><p class=\"lg\">及以無等尊，<caesura/>於彼而出興。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b05\">0259b05</span><p class=\"lg\">如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259003\">是＝見【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259003\">是【大】，見【聖】</span><app n=\"0259003\"><p class=\"lg\">是</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">見</rdg></app>過去佛，<caesura/>大願出<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259004\">于＝於【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0259004\">于【大】＊，於【明】＊</span><app n=\"0259004\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">於</rdg></app>世，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b06\">0259b06</span><p class=\"lg\">云何為眾生，<caesura/>滅除諸苦惱？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b07\">0259b07</span><p class=\"lg\">一切論師子，<caesura/>所行相續滿，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b08\">0259b08</span><p class=\"lg\">得佛平等法，<caesura/>一切智境界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b09\">0259b09</span><p class=\"lg\">見於過去世，<caesura/>一切人師子，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b10\">0259b10</span><p class=\"lg\">放大光明網，<caesura/>普照十方界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b11\">0259b11</span><p class=\"lg\">思惟發是願：<caesura/>『我當作世燈，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b12\">0259b12</span><p class=\"lg\">具足佛功德，<caesura/>十力一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b13\">0259b13</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸眾生，<caesura/>貪恚癡熾然；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b14\">0259b14</span><p class=\"lg\">我當悉救脫，<caesura/>令滅惡道苦。』</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b15\">0259b15</span><p class=\"lg\">發如是誓願，<caesura/>堅固不退轉，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b16\">0259b16</span><p class=\"lg\">具修菩薩行，<caesura/>獲十無礙力。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b17\">0259b17</span><p class=\"lg\">如是誓願已，<caesura/>修行無退怯，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b18\">0259b18</span><p class=\"lg\">所作皆不虛，<caesura/>說名論師子。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b19\">0259b19</span><p class=\"lg\">於一賢劫中，<caesura/>千佛出<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0259004\"><p class=\"lg\">于</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">於</rdg></app>世，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b20\">0259b20</span><p class=\"lg\">彼所有普眼，<caesura/>我當次第說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b21\">0259b21</span><p class=\"lg\">如一賢劫中，<caesura/>無量劫亦然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b22\">0259b22</span><p class=\"lg\">彼未來佛行，<caesura/>我當分別說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b23\">0259b23</span><p class=\"lg\">如一佛剎種，<caesura/>無量剎亦然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b24\">0259b24</span><p class=\"lg\">未來十力尊，<caesura/>諸行我今說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b25\">0259b25</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛次興世，<caesura/>隨願隨名號，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b26\">0259b26</span><p class=\"lg\">隨彼所得記，<caesura/>隨其所壽命，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b27\">0259b27</span><p class=\"lg\">隨所修正法，<caesura/>專求無礙道；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b28\">0259b28</span><p class=\"lg\">隨所化眾生，<caesura/>正法住於世；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259b29\">0259b29</span><p class=\"lg\">隨所淨佛剎，<caesura/>眾生及法輪，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c01\">0259c01</span><p class=\"lg\">演說時非時，<caesura/>次第淨群生；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c02\">0259c02</span><p class=\"lg\">隨諸眾生業，<caesura/>所行及信解，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c03\">0259c03</span><p class=\"lg\">上中下不同，<caesura/>化彼令修習。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c04\">0259c04</span><p class=\"lg\">入於如是智，<caesura/>修其最勝行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c05\">0259c05</span><p class=\"lg\">常作普賢業，<caesura/>廣度諸眾生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c06\">0259c06</span><p class=\"lg\">身業無障礙，<caesura/>語業悉清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c07\">0259c07</span><p class=\"lg\">意行亦如是，<caesura/>三世靡不然。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c08\">0259c08</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩如是行，<caesura/>究竟普賢道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c09\">0259c09</span><p class=\"lg\">出生淨智日，<caesura/>普照於法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c10\">0259c10</span><p class=\"lg\">未來世諸劫，<caesura/>國土不可說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c11\">0259c11</span><p class=\"lg\">一念悉了知，<caesura/>於彼無分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c12\">0259c12</span><p class=\"lg\">行者能趣入，<caesura/>如是最勝地，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c13\">0259c13</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸菩薩法，<caesura/>我當說少分。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c14\">0259c14</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧無邊際，<caesura/>通達佛境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c15\">0259c15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆善入，<caesura/>所行不退轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c16\">0259c16</span><p class=\"lg\">具足普賢慧，<caesura/>成滿普賢願，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c17\">0259c17</span><p class=\"lg\">入於無等智，<caesura/>我當說彼行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c18\">0259c18</span><p class=\"lg\">於一微塵中，<caesura/>悉見諸世界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c19\">0259c19</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生若聞者，<caesura/>迷亂心發狂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c20\">0259c20</span><p class=\"lg\">如於一微塵，<caesura/>一切塵亦然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c21\">0259c21</span><p class=\"lg\">世界悉入中，<caesura/>如是不思議。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c22\">0259c22</span><p class=\"lg\">一一塵中有，<caesura/>十方三世法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c23\">0259c23</span><p class=\"lg\">趣剎皆無量，<caesura/>悉能分別知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c24\">0259c24</span><p class=\"lg\">一一塵中有，<caesura/>無量種佛剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c25\">0259c25</span><p class=\"lg\">種種皆無量，<caesura/>於一靡不知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c26\">0259c26</span><p class=\"lg\">法界中所有，<caesura/>種種諸異相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c27\">0259c27</span><p class=\"lg\">趣類各差別，<caesura/>悉能分別知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c28\">0259c28</span><p class=\"lg\">深入微細智，<caesura/>分別諸世界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0259c29\">0259c29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切劫成壞，<caesura/>悉能明了說。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a01\">0260a01</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸劫修短，<caesura/>三世即一念，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a02\">0260a02</span><p class=\"lg\">眾行同不同，<caesura/>悉能分別知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a03\">0260a03</span><p class=\"lg\">深入諸世界，<caesura/>廣大非廣大，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a04\">0260a04</span><p class=\"lg\">一身無量剎，<caesura/>一剎無量身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a05\">0260a05</span><p class=\"lg\">十方中所有，<caesura/>異類諸世界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a06\">0260a06</span><p class=\"lg\">廣大無量相，<caesura/>一切悉能知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a07\">0260a07</span><p class=\"lg\">一切三世中，<caesura/>無量諸國土，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a08\">0260a08</span><p class=\"lg\">具足甚深智，<caesura/>悉了彼成敗。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a09\">0260a09</span><p class=\"lg\">十方諸世界，<caesura/>有成或有壞，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a10\">0260a10</span><p class=\"lg\">如是不可說，<caesura/>賢德悉深了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a11\">0260a11</span><p class=\"lg\">或有諸國土，<caesura/>種種地嚴飾；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a12\">0260a12</span><p class=\"lg\">諸趣亦復然，<caesura/>斯由業清淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a13\">0260a13</span><p class=\"lg\">或有諸世界，<caesura/>無量種雜染；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a14\">0260a14</span><p class=\"lg\">斯由眾生感，<caesura/>一切如其行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a15\">0260a15</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無邊剎，<caesura/>了知即一剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a16\">0260a16</span><p class=\"lg\">如是入諸剎，<caesura/>其數不可知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a17\">0260a17</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸世界，<caesura/>悉入一剎中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a18\">0260a18</span><p class=\"lg\">世界不為一，<caesura/>亦復無雜亂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a19\">0260a19</span><p class=\"lg\">世界有仰覆，<caesura/>或高或復下，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a20\">0260a20</span><p class=\"lg\">皆是眾生想，<caesura/>悉能分別知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a21\">0260a21</span><p class=\"lg\">廣博諸世界，<caesura/>無量無有邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a22\">0260a22</span><p class=\"lg\">知種種是一，<caesura/>知一是種種。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a23\">0260a23</span><p class=\"lg\">普賢諸佛子，<caesura/>能以普賢智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a24\">0260a24</span><p class=\"lg\">了知諸剎數，<caesura/>其數無邊際。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a25\">0260a25</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸世界化，<caesura/>剎化眾生化，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a26\">0260a26</span><p class=\"lg\">法化諸佛化，<caesura/>一切皆究竟。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a27\">0260a27</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸世界，<caesura/>微細廣大剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a28\">0260a28</span><p class=\"lg\">種種異莊嚴，<caesura/>皆由業所起。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260a29\">0260a29</span><p class=\"lg\">無量諸佛子，<caesura/>善學入法界，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b01\">0260b01</span><p class=\"lg\">神通力自在，<caesura/>普遍於十方。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b02\">0260b02</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生數等劫，<caesura/>說彼世界名，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b03\">0260b03</span><p class=\"lg\">亦不能令盡，<caesura/>唯除佛開示。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b04\">0260b04</span><p class=\"lg\">世界及如來，<caesura/>種種諸名號，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b05\">0260b05</span><p class=\"lg\">經於無量劫，<caesura/>說之不可盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b06\">0260b06</span><p class=\"lg\">何況最勝智，<caesura/>三世諸佛法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b07\">0260b07</span><p class=\"lg\">從於法界生，<caesura/>充滿如來地！</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b08\">0260b08</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨無礙念，<caesura/>無邊無礙慧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b09\">0260b09</span><p class=\"lg\">分別說法界，<caesura/>得至於彼岸。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b10\">0260b10</span><p class=\"lg\">過去諸世界，<caesura/>廣大及微細，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b11\">0260b11</span><p class=\"lg\">修習所莊嚴，<caesura/>一念悉能知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b12\">0260b12</span><p class=\"lg\">其中人師子，<caesura/>修佛種種行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b13\">0260b13</span><p class=\"lg\">成於等正覺，<caesura/>示現諸自在。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b14\">0260b14</span><p class=\"lg\">如是未來世，<caesura/>次第無量劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b15\">0260b15</span><p class=\"lg\">所有人中尊，<caesura/>菩薩悉能知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b16\">0260b16</span><p class=\"lg\">所有諸行願，<caesura/>所有諸境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b17\">0260b17</span><p class=\"lg\">如是勤修行，<caesura/>於中成正覺。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b18\">0260b18</span><p class=\"lg\">亦知彼眾會，<caesura/>壽命化眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b19\">0260b19</span><p class=\"lg\">以此諸法門，<caesura/>為眾轉法輪。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b20\">0260b20</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩如是知，<caesura/>住普賢行地，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b21\">0260b21</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧悉明了，<caesura/>出生一切佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b22\">0260b22</span><p class=\"lg\">現在世所攝，<caesura/>一切諸佛土，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b23\">0260b23</span><p class=\"lg\">深入此諸剎，<caesura/>通達於法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b24\">0260b24</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸世界中，<caesura/>現在一切佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b25\">0260b25</span><p class=\"lg\">於法得自在，<caesura/>言論無所礙。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b26\">0260b26</span><p class=\"lg\">亦知彼眾會，<caesura/>淨土應化力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b27\">0260b27</span><p class=\"lg\">盡無量億劫，<caesura/>常思惟是事。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b28\">0260b28</span><p class=\"lg\">調御世間尊，<caesura/>所有威神力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260b29\">0260b29</span><p class=\"lg\">無盡智慧藏，<caesura/>一切悉能知。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c01\">0260c01</span><p class=\"lg\">出生無礙眼，<caesura/>無礙耳鼻身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c02\">0260c02</span><p class=\"lg\">無礙廣長舌，<caesura/>能令眾歡喜。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c03\">0260c03</span><p class=\"lg\">最勝無礙心，<caesura/>廣大普清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c04\">0260c04</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧遍充滿，<caesura/>悉知三世法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c05\">0260c05</span><p class=\"lg\">善學一切化，<caesura/>剎化眾生化，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c06\">0260c06</span><p class=\"lg\">世化調伏化，<caesura/>究竟化彼岸。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c07\">0260c07</span><p class=\"lg\">世間種種別，<caesura/>皆由於想住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c08\">0260c08</span><p class=\"lg\">入佛方便智，<caesura/>於此悉明了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c09\">0260c09</span><p class=\"lg\">眾會不可說，<caesura/>一一為現身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c10\">0260c10</span><p class=\"lg\">悉使見如來，<caesura/>度脫無邊眾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c11\">0260c11</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛甚深智，<caesura/>如日出世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c12\">0260c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切國土中，<caesura/>普現無休息。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c13\">0260c13</span><p class=\"lg\">了達諸世間，<caesura/>假名無有實，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c14\">0260c14</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生及世界，<caesura/>如夢如光影。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c15\">0260c15</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸世間法，<caesura/>不生分別見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c16\">0260c16</span><p class=\"lg\">善離分別者，<caesura/>亦不見分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c17\">0260c17</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無數劫，<caesura/>解之即一念，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c18\">0260c18</span><p class=\"lg\">知念亦無念，<caesura/>如是見世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c19\">0260c19</span><p class=\"lg\">無量諸國土，<caesura/>一念悉超越，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c20\">0260c20</span><p class=\"lg\">經於無量劫，<caesura/>不動於本處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c21\">0260c21</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說諸劫，<caesura/>即是須臾頃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c22\">0260c22</span><p class=\"lg\">莫見修與短，<caesura/>究竟剎那法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c23\">0260c23</span><p class=\"lg\">心住於世間，<caesura/>世間住於心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c24\">0260c24</span><p class=\"lg\">於此不妄起，<caesura/>二非二分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c25\">0260c25</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生世界劫，<caesura/>諸佛及佛法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c26\">0260c26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切如幻化，<caesura/>法界悉平等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c27\">0260c27</span><p class=\"lg\">普於十方剎，<caesura/>示現無量身，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c28\">0260c28</span><p class=\"lg\">知身從緣起，<caesura/>究竟無所著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0260c29\">0260c29</span><p class=\"lg\">依於無二智，<caesura/>出現人師子，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a01\">0261a01</span><p class=\"lg\">不著無二法，<caesura/>知無二非二。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a02\">0261a02</span><p class=\"lg\">了知諸世間，<caesura/>如焰如光影，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a03\">0261a03</span><p class=\"lg\">如響亦如夢，<caesura/>如幻如變化。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a04\">0261a04</span><p class=\"lg\">如是隨順入，<caesura/>諸佛所行處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a05\">0261a05</span><p class=\"lg\">成就普賢智，<caesura/>普照深法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a06\">0261a06</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生剎染著，<caesura/>一切皆捨離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a07\">0261a07</span><p class=\"lg\">而興大悲心，<caesura/>普淨諸世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a08\">0261a08</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩常正念，<caesura/>論師子妙法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a09\">0261a09</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨如虛空，<caesura/>而興大方便。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a10\">0261a10</span><p class=\"lg\">見世常迷倒，<caesura/>發心咸救度，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a11\">0261a11</span><p class=\"lg\">所行皆清淨，<caesura/>普遍諸法界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a12\">0261a12</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛及菩薩，<caesura/>佛法世間法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a13\">0261a13</span><p class=\"lg\">若見其真實，<caesura/>一切無差別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a14\">0261a14</span><p class=\"lg\">如來法身藏，<caesura/>普入世間中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a15\">0261a15</span><p class=\"lg\">雖在於世間，<caesura/>於世無所著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a16\">0261a16</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如清淨水，<caesura/>影像無來去；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a17\">0261a17</span><p class=\"lg\">法身遍世間，<caesura/>當知亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a18\">0261a18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是離染著，<caesura/>身世皆清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a19\">0261a19</span><p class=\"lg\">湛然如虛空，<caesura/>一切無有生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a20\">0261a20</span><p class=\"lg\">知身無有盡，<caesura/>無生亦無滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a21\">0261a21</span><p class=\"lg\">非常非無常，<caesura/>示現諸世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a22\">0261a22</span><p class=\"lg\">除滅諸邪見，<caesura/>開示於正見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a23\">0261a23</span><p class=\"lg\">法性無來去，<caesura/>不著我我所。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a24\">0261a24</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如工幻師，<caesura/>示現種種事，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a25\">0261a25</span><p class=\"lg\">其來無所從，<caesura/>去亦無所至。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a26\">0261a26</span><p class=\"lg\">幻性非有量，<caesura/>亦復非無量，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a27\">0261a27</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼大眾中，<caesura/>示現量無量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a28\">0261a28</span><p class=\"lg\">以此寂定心，<caesura/>修習諸善根，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261a29\">0261a29</span><p class=\"lg\">出生一切佛，<caesura/>非量非無量。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b01\">0261b01</span><p class=\"lg\">有量及無量，<caesura/>皆悉是妄想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b02\">0261b02</span><p class=\"lg\">了達一切趣，<caesura/>不著量無量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b03\">0261b03</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛甚深法，<caesura/>廣大深寂滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b04\">0261b04</span><p class=\"lg\">甚深無量智，<caesura/>知甚深諸趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b05\">0261b05</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩離迷倒，<caesura/>心淨常相續，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b06\">0261b06</span><p class=\"lg\">巧以神通力，<caesura/>度無量眾生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b07\">0261b07</span><p class=\"lg\">未安者令安，<caesura/>安者示道場，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b08\">0261b08</span><p class=\"lg\">如是遍法界，<caesura/>其心無所著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b09\">0261b09</span><p class=\"lg\">不住於實際，<caesura/>不入於涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b10\">0261b10</span><p class=\"lg\">如是遍世間，<caesura/>開悟諸群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b11\">0261b11</span><p class=\"lg\">法數眾生數，<caesura/>了知而不著，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b12\">0261b12</span><p class=\"lg\">普雨於法雨，<caesura/>充洽諸世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b13\">0261b13</span><p class=\"lg\">普於諸世界，<caesura/>念念成正覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b14\">0261b14</span><p class=\"lg\">而修菩薩行，<caesura/>未曾有退轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b15\">0261b15</span><p class=\"lg\">世間種種身，<caesura/>一切悉了知；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b16\">0261b16</span><p class=\"lg\">如是知身法，<caesura/>則得諸佛身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b17\">0261b17</span><p class=\"lg\">普知諸眾生，<caesura/>諸劫及諸剎，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b18\">0261b18</span><p class=\"lg\">十方無涯際，<caesura/>智海無不入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b19\">0261b19</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生身無量，<caesura/>一一為現身；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b20\">0261b20</span><p class=\"lg\">佛身無有邊，<caesura/>智者悉觀見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b21\">0261b21</span><p class=\"lg\">一念之所知，<caesura/>出現諸如來，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b22\">0261b22</span><p class=\"lg\">經於無量劫，<caesura/>稱揚不可盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b23\">0261b23</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛能現身，<caesura/>處處般涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b24\">0261b24</span><p class=\"lg\">一念中無量，<caesura/>舍利各差別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b25\">0261b25</span><p class=\"lg\">如是未來世，<caesura/>有求於佛果，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b26\">0261b26</span><p class=\"lg\">無量菩提心，<caesura/>決定智悉知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b27\">0261b27</span><p class=\"lg\">如是三世中，<caesura/>所有諸如來，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b28\">0261b28</span><p class=\"lg\">一切悉能知，<caesura/>名住普賢行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261b29\">0261b29</span><p class=\"lg\">如是分別知，<caesura/>無量諸行地，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c01\">0261c01</span><p class=\"lg\">入於智慧處，<caesura/>其輪不退轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c02\">0261c02</span><p class=\"lg\">微妙廣大智，<caesura/>深入如來境，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c03\">0261c03</span><p class=\"lg\">入已不退轉，<caesura/>說名普賢慧。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c04\">0261c04</span><p class=\"lg\">一切最勝尊，<caesura/>普入佛境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c05\">0261c05</span><p class=\"lg\">修行不退轉，<caesura/>得無上菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c06\">0261c06</span><p class=\"lg\">無量無邊心，<caesura/>各各差別業，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c07\">0261c07</span><p class=\"lg\">皆由想積集，<caesura/>平等悉了知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c08\">0261c08</span><p class=\"lg\">染污非染污，<caesura/>學心無學心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c09\">0261c09</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說諸心，<caesura/>念念中悉知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c10\">0261c10</span><p class=\"lg\">了知非一二，<caesura/>非染亦非淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c11\">0261c11</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復無雜亂，<caesura/>皆從自想起。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c12\">0261c12</span><p class=\"lg\">如是悉明見，<caesura/>一切諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c13\">0261c13</span><p class=\"lg\">心想各不同，<caesura/>起種種世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c14\">0261c14</span><p class=\"lg\">以如是方便，<caesura/>修諸最勝行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c15\">0261c15</span><p class=\"lg\">從佛法化生，<caesura/>得名為普賢。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c16\">0261c16</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生皆妄起，<caesura/>善惡諸趣想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c17\">0261c17</span><p class=\"lg\">由是或生天，<caesura/>或復墮地獄。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c18\">0261c18</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩觀世間，<caesura/>妄想業所起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c19\">0261c19</span><p class=\"lg\">妄想無邊故，<caesura/>世間亦無量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c20\">0261c20</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸國土，<caesura/>想網之所現，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c21\">0261c21</span><p class=\"lg\">幻網方便故，<caesura/>一念悉能入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c22\">0261c22</span><p class=\"lg\">眼耳鼻舌身，<caesura/>意根亦如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c23\">0261c23</span><p class=\"lg\">世間想別異，<caesura/>平等皆能入。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c24\">0261c24</span><p class=\"lg\">一一眼境界，<caesura/>無量眼皆入，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c25\">0261c25</span><p class=\"lg\">種種性差別，<caesura/>無量不可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c26\">0261c26</span><p class=\"lg\">所見無差別，<caesura/>亦復無雜亂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c27\">0261c27</span><p class=\"lg\">各隨於自業，<caesura/>受用其果報。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c28\">0261c28</span><p class=\"lg\">普賢力無量，<caesura/>悉知彼一切，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0261c29\">0261c29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眼境界，<caesura/>大智悉能入。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a01\">0262a01</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸世間，<caesura/>悉能分別知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a02\">0262a02</span><p class=\"lg\">而修一切行，<caesura/>亦復無退轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a03\">0262a03</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說眾生說，<caesura/>及以國土說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a04\">0262a04</span><p class=\"lg\">三世如是說，<caesura/>種種悉了知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a05\">0262a05</span><p class=\"lg\">過去中未來，<caesura/>未來中現在，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a06\">0262a06</span><p class=\"lg\">三世互相見，<caesura/>一一皆明了。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a07\">0262a07</span><p class=\"lg\">如是無量種，<caesura/>開悟諸世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a08\">0262a08</span><p class=\"lg\">一切智方便，<caesura/>邊際不可得。」</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0262a09\">0262a09</span><cb:juan n=\"049\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大方廣佛華嚴經</title>卷第四十九</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}